      "writtenOn": "2019-11-25T07:54:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We desire \"+\" operator here. \n\nAs per 3GPP TS 29002 MAP Specification : Section 17.7.10, the BearerServiceCode for \"allDataCircuitAsynchronous\" is \u002701010000\u0027 ( i.e. 80). Hence, SERVICE_CLASS_DATA_SYNC (1\u003c\u003c4) and SERVICE_CLASS_PACKET (1\u003c\u003c6) together make video service class.\n\nHence, 1\u003c\u003c4 : 16 and 1\u003c\u003c6 : 64\nSo, adding them will give us the desired result 80. (Modem also wants this value).\n\nAlso, same \"+\" operator is used at other existing places -\u003e \n\n\nhttp://androidxref.com/8.0.0_r4/xref/frameworks/opt/telephony/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/imsphone/ImsPhoneMmiCode.java#398\n\nhttp://androidxref.com/8.0.0_r4/xref/frameworks/opt/telephony/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/gsm/GsmMmiCode.java#472",
      "parentUuid": "a641bed8_48376ae5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1543,
        "startChar": 45,
        "endLine": 1543,
        "endChar": 91
      },
      "revId": "fecf57b6c2c8594a268ea821f1ad92d64f4788e7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
